WEBVTT

00:00:01.051 --> 00:00:03.119
Do you know
about Season Fairies?

00:00:03.119 --> 00:00:06.323
They're little fairies
who govern the seasons...

00:00:06.323 --> 00:00:07.724
But... can you believe it?

00:00:07.724 --> 00:00:10.060
It tumbled into my
room, of all places.

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:11.661
Are you listening
to me, Sugar?

00:00:11.661 --> 00:00:16.064
Hmm, I wonder if that
Mr. Bear could see me?

00:00:16.366 --> 00:00:20.070
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:22.972
On my lips

00:00:22.972 --> 00:00:26.499
The rouge of tears

00:00:47.597 --> 00:00:51.034
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:51.034 --> 00:00:58.566
I don't want to know
such a thing as love.

00:01:02.045 --> 00:01:05.782
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:05.782 --> 00:01:08.585
On my lips

00:01:08.585 --> 00:01:12.043
The rouge of tears

00:01:16.426 --> 00:01:19.662
On Thursdays

00:01:19.662 --> 00:01:23.166
I buy roses and...

00:01:23.166 --> 00:01:27.364
add a letter

00:01:31.074 --> 00:01:34.210
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:34.210 --> 00:01:37.580
When I see you in my dreams

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:42.142
you're so caring

00:02:14.918 --> 00:02:16.715
Why did he play
the piano like that?

00:02:17.654 --> 00:02:19.456
I can't forgive him.

00:02:19.456 --> 00:02:22.482
You think so, too,
don't you, Mom?

00:02:23.293 --> 00:02:25.056
Mr. Bear...

00:02:25.762 --> 00:02:27.286
...Waffo!

00:02:34.804 --> 00:02:37.068
H-Hello.
G-Good-bye.

00:02:59.162 --> 00:03:01.097
Hey, let's go.
Let's go!

00:03:01.097 --> 00:03:03.399
Let's go see
Mr. Bear, Saga.

00:03:03.399 --> 00:03:06.095
He'll play the
piano again today.

00:03:06.536 --> 00:03:09.096
No, I'm busy.

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:12.934
Why do you want to
see it so many times?

00:03:13.309 --> 00:03:17.814
Anyway, I'm not interested in
The Bear Pianist. Besides...

00:03:17.814 --> 00:03:19.372
Look, Mr. Bear!

00:03:21.618 --> 00:03:23.142
Does it look like him?

00:03:23.286 --> 00:03:25.015
Yeah. Yeah.

00:03:26.022 --> 00:03:26.920
Wel...

00:03:27.023 --> 00:03:28.752
Hello, Saga.

00:03:29.859 --> 00:03:31.053
Welcome.

00:03:32.061 --> 00:03:33.323
It's Mr. Bear.

00:03:34.097 --> 00:03:36.065
Hey, about the play.

00:03:36.466 --> 00:03:38.668
Did you enjoy it?

00:03:38.668 --> 00:03:41.364
It was fun, wasn't it?
Right, Saga? Right?
Um, I've got to clean up.

00:03:48.378 --> 00:03:52.212
Ooh. And here I thought we
could be friends with Mr. Bear.

00:03:52.448 --> 00:03:55.076
I don't want to
be friends with him.

00:03:55.585 --> 00:03:56.347
Um.

00:03:56.586 --> 00:03:57.348
Huh?

00:03:57.787 --> 00:03:59.118
Can I get a blend?

00:03:59.589 --> 00:04:01.284
Ah, um...

00:04:01.391 --> 00:04:03.086
A blend. Right.

00:04:04.494 --> 00:04:05.728
I'm back!

00:04:05.728 --> 00:04:07.889
Mr. Luchino,
I need a blend please!

00:04:08.298 --> 00:04:10.960
Yes, just a minute.

00:04:16.005 --> 00:04:17.267
You're busy.

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:20.336
But I wanted to
drink your coffee, Saga.

00:04:28.851 --> 00:04:30.546
Mr. Bear! Mr. Bear!

00:04:37.493 --> 00:04:38.755
Oh, this.

00:04:40.597 --> 00:04:42.064
Just like it...

00:04:42.565 --> 00:04:44.801
Huh? Um.

00:04:44.801 --> 00:04:46.402
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:04:46.402 --> 00:04:47.266
Thank you.

00:04:51.341 --> 00:04:52.603
I knew it.

00:04:55.545 --> 00:04:57.069
He knows about
"Twinkles"?

00:04:57.380 --> 00:04:58.581
Vincent does?

00:04:58.581 --> 00:04:59.616
It's true.

00:04:59.616 --> 00:05:00.776
I'm sure of it!

00:05:01.184 --> 00:05:05.288
I thought he was suspicious
ever since we met him.

00:05:05.288 --> 00:05:07.523
Well, he is a piano
playing bear, after all!

00:05:07.523 --> 00:05:10.788
It wouldn't be strange
if he could see us.

00:05:12.061 --> 00:05:15.053
Yeah, and that time, too.

00:05:17.433 --> 00:05:19.094
That's how it was
that time, too.

00:05:25.575 --> 00:05:27.236
And then today.

00:05:29.045 --> 00:05:31.114
That has to be it.

00:05:31.114 --> 00:05:33.049
Mr. Bear can see us!

00:05:33.049 --> 00:05:36.382
Then he must know
something about "Twinkles"!

00:05:36.786 --> 00:05:39.222
The Elder said that "Twinkles"

00:05:39.222 --> 00:05:43.318
are near humans who
can see Season Fairies.

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:44.624
Ok!

00:05:44.894 --> 00:05:48.798
The "stick-close-to-Mr. Bear-
and-find-"Twinkle" plan begins!

00:05:48.798 --> 00:05:49.866
Yeah!

00:05:49.866 --> 00:05:52.061
W-Wait a minute.
You guys!

00:05:52.435 --> 00:05:54.369
Just wait, Saga.

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:57.073
This time we'll
find a "Twinkle".

00:05:57.073 --> 00:05:58.563
Oh, Sugar!

00:06:12.055 --> 00:06:14.615
Sugar keeps talking about
that bear all the time.

00:06:14.991 --> 00:06:17.050
Not that I care.

00:06:17.527 --> 00:06:18.357
Ooh!

00:06:18.795 --> 00:06:19.955
Oww.

00:06:54.697 --> 00:06:57.834
What's with this,
so early in the morning?

00:06:57.834 --> 00:06:58.823
Oh, my.

00:07:02.505 --> 00:07:04.496
Oh, good morning.

00:07:07.577 --> 00:07:09.340
Good morning.

00:07:09.779 --> 00:07:11.547
You're working
hard this morning,

00:07:11.547 --> 00:07:13.481
and we're not
even performing today.

00:07:13.683 --> 00:07:14.951
Well, of course.

00:07:14.951 --> 00:07:18.079
You never know when
a fan might be listening.

00:07:21.090 --> 00:07:23.793
Well, then,
tell your fans "hello."

00:07:23.793 --> 00:07:26.455
We'll be leaving
this town soon.

00:07:26.863 --> 00:07:28.598
Could the fans be...

00:07:28.598 --> 00:07:30.088
Us?

00:07:32.835 --> 00:07:35.827
Now, I wonder what's
for breakfast today...

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:40.001
Is he making fun of us?

00:07:45.047 --> 00:07:46.446
Isn't it great?

00:07:46.949 --> 00:07:50.820
I had a photographer enlarge
the one in the program.

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:52.955
The more I look at him,
the more wonderful he seems!

00:07:52.955 --> 00:07:53.819
Don't you think?

00:07:54.056 --> 00:07:55.045
Yeah...

00:07:55.625 --> 00:07:59.721
And today I was thinking
of going to see him backstage.

00:08:00.263 --> 00:08:02.698
If I could get his autograph,
that'd be so cool!

00:08:02.698 --> 00:08:05.067
I don't know if we'll be
able to see him or not.

00:08:05.067 --> 00:08:08.594
But it would be nice to ask
him about the play and stuff.

00:08:08.805 --> 00:08:10.500
Hey, do you want
to come, too, Saga?

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:11.572
Huh?

00:08:12.842 --> 00:08:15.743
Sorry, I've got plans today.

00:08:16.078 --> 00:08:17.079
I see.

00:08:17.079 --> 00:08:17.647
Ok.

00:08:17.647 --> 00:08:20.316
Then I'll get an
autograph for you, too, Saga.

00:08:20.316 --> 00:08:23.753
Oh, I can't wait to see him!
My beloved one...

00:08:23.753 --> 00:08:26.313
Oh, are you still chasing him?

00:08:26.923 --> 00:08:29.725
Miss Saga, you guys
are so childish,

00:08:29.725 --> 00:08:32.461
getting so excited
over a play like that.

00:08:32.461 --> 00:08:34.797
What do you mean
"a play like that"?

00:08:34.797 --> 00:08:38.534
A cheap, childish,
tear-jerker like that.

00:08:38.534 --> 00:08:41.765
It's not good enough for a
first-class person like me.

00:08:46.475 --> 00:08:48.238
Hansel Pieve!

00:08:49.812 --> 00:08:51.109
-She's addicted.
-She's addicted.

00:08:54.917 --> 00:08:57.647
But it really is a fun play.

00:08:57.987 --> 00:09:00.423
The bear's a good
piano player, too...

00:09:00.423 --> 00:09:01.253
...right, Saga?

00:09:01.424 --> 00:09:02.083
Huh?

00:09:02.358 --> 00:09:03.950
Yeah, I guess.

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:04.958
Yeah.

00:09:05.194 --> 00:09:08.425
Just listening to his piano
playing makes me all fluttery.

00:09:09.799 --> 00:09:14.570
Even I will admit his
piano playing is good.

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:16.772
Who is she to judge?

00:09:16.772 --> 00:09:20.076
Norma, will you get an
autograph for me, too?

00:09:20.076 --> 00:09:21.566
If you give me
one of your toys.

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:32.054
Plan 1:

00:09:32.054 --> 00:09:36.025
First we'll see if he
really can see us.

00:09:36.025 --> 00:09:38.594
Hey, he's not responding at all.

00:09:38.594 --> 00:09:41.028
Maybe we're not funny?

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:48.632
Plan 2:

00:09:49.272 --> 00:09:52.575
Keep your eyes on
everything he looks at!

00:09:52.575 --> 00:09:54.372
It might be a "Twinkle"!

00:09:56.646 --> 00:09:58.170
Oh, hello.

00:09:59.048 --> 00:10:00.037
Oh, that's it!

00:10:02.652 --> 00:10:04.051
Are you a "Twinkle"?

00:10:09.458 --> 00:10:10.390
This looks delicious.

00:10:10.760 --> 00:10:12.625
This time we've
found our "Twinkle"!

00:10:15.064 --> 00:10:16.053
Yay!

00:10:17.133 --> 00:10:18.327
What?

00:10:22.071 --> 00:10:23.698
Oh, my.

00:10:25.675 --> 00:10:29.839
Nice to meet you.
Are you "Twinkles"?

00:10:30.279 --> 00:10:31.837
Well, then. Goodbye.

00:10:32.481 --> 00:10:33.816
Over there, over there!

00:10:33.816 --> 00:10:35.340
This time we've got it!

00:10:35.418 --> 00:10:36.350
Please wait!

00:10:36.452 --> 00:10:37.350
Over there, over there!

00:10:40.756 --> 00:10:43.359
It seems like
they're all wrong.

00:10:43.359 --> 00:10:47.625
Who was it who said there was
a "Twinkle" near him, anyway?

00:10:47.863 --> 00:10:49.023
I wonder if I was wrong.

00:10:53.269 --> 00:10:55.938
Please wait for me, Ginger!

00:10:55.938 --> 00:10:57.974
A date! A date!

00:10:57.974 --> 00:11:01.577
Let's have a
rendezvous, Ginger.

00:11:01.577 --> 00:11:04.045
I'm working right now!

00:11:05.748 --> 00:11:08.284
She's making the
rain showy, as usual.

00:11:08.284 --> 00:11:09.717
Hey, look.

00:11:24.066 --> 00:11:27.136
Did the bear see
Rain Fairy Ginger

00:11:27.136 --> 00:11:29.772
and know we'd have
a rain shower?

00:11:29.772 --> 00:11:31.707
Then, that means...

00:11:31.707 --> 00:11:33.342
The bear can see us!

00:11:33.342 --> 00:11:35.333
He can see
Season Fairies!

00:11:53.662 --> 00:11:57.621
Just listening to his piano
playing makes me all fluttery.

00:11:58.100 --> 00:12:03.094
Even I will admit his
piano playing is good.

00:12:05.374 --> 00:12:07.604
The Bear Pianist...

00:12:09.545 --> 00:12:10.413
Welco...

00:12:10.413 --> 00:12:11.675
I'm back!

00:12:12.281 --> 00:12:13.441
Welcome back.

00:12:13.983 --> 00:12:17.119
Looks like you were
waiting for someone to come.

00:12:17.119 --> 00:12:17.778
Huh?

00:12:18.154 --> 00:12:19.917
That's not true!

00:12:20.122 --> 00:12:22.525
Now that I think of it,
he hasn't shown his face today.

00:12:22.525 --> 00:12:24.117
That weird guy.

00:12:24.226 --> 00:12:25.853
L-Is that right?

00:12:25.961 --> 00:12:27.530
Don't worry about it.

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:29.899
I like your blend, Saga.

00:12:29.899 --> 00:12:32.735
I'm not worrying about it.

00:12:32.735 --> 00:12:33.929
Really?

00:12:38.074 --> 00:12:41.339
Of course not. Really.

00:12:41.944 --> 00:12:44.412
I'll be back in a minute
Please wait.

00:12:44.613 --> 00:12:45.981
Thank you very much.

00:12:45.981 --> 00:12:47.972
Gotta treat the fans well.

00:12:49.518 --> 00:12:50.352
No way!

00:12:50.352 --> 00:12:52.488
I can't believe we
can see him this easy!

00:12:52.488 --> 00:12:54.285
Is my hair messed up?

00:12:54.523 --> 00:12:56.358
Does this outfit
make me look good?

00:12:56.358 --> 00:12:59.462
Anne, I'm so excited!

00:12:59.462 --> 00:13:01.020
Don't worry.

00:13:01.297 --> 00:13:02.730
Now smile. Smile!

00:13:05.101 --> 00:13:07.369
I've been a fan since
the first time I saw you!

00:13:07.369 --> 00:13:09.098
I'll always,
always root for you!!

00:13:09.905 --> 00:13:11.507
Oh, is this for me?

00:13:11.507 --> 00:13:12.708
Huh?

00:13:12.708 --> 00:13:14.005
Me?

00:13:14.477 --> 00:13:15.671
Thank you.

00:13:15.878 --> 00:13:17.311
I love it.

00:13:17.746 --> 00:13:18.747
I mean...

00:13:18.747 --> 00:13:19.849
This person!

00:13:19.849 --> 00:13:22.685
Oh, you have such
a big picture of me!

00:13:22.685 --> 00:13:24.448
How embarrassing.

00:13:24.753 --> 00:13:26.220
It doesn't even
look like me!

00:13:26.589 --> 00:13:27.317
What!

00:13:27.590 --> 00:13:30.855
Then... this isn't a man?
It's a woman?

00:13:32.261 --> 00:13:32.828
Huh?

00:13:32.828 --> 00:13:35.058
You didn't know, Norma?

00:13:37.766 --> 00:13:39.427
No way!

00:13:48.844 --> 00:13:50.641
What pretty clouds.

00:13:56.152 --> 00:13:58.916
The clouds look
different today.

00:14:13.102 --> 00:14:16.872
It seems like he
knows Turmeric, too.

00:14:16.872 --> 00:14:18.274
That cinches it!

00:14:18.274 --> 00:14:20.776
He knows about
Season Fairies!

00:14:20.776 --> 00:14:22.835
Right, Sugar?

00:14:27.783 --> 00:14:31.048
Is he going to eat
that waffo or not?

00:14:33.822 --> 00:14:35.291
You want me to eat it?

00:14:35.291 --> 00:14:36.383
Waffo!

00:14:37.693 --> 00:14:40.423
I always thought you were
a nice person, Mr. Bear!

00:14:40.529 --> 00:14:42.264
Ok, I'll take it!

00:14:42.264 --> 00:14:43.253
Oh, I forgot.

00:14:46.068 --> 00:14:47.436
Ouch.

00:14:47.436 --> 00:14:48.198
Huh?

00:14:48.437 --> 00:14:49.471
Why?

00:14:49.471 --> 00:14:51.462
Maybe he did it on purpose.

00:14:52.408 --> 00:14:54.069
I'm going to eat it.

00:14:57.079 --> 00:14:59.479
What a strange person.

00:15:00.082 --> 00:15:02.952
Now we'll have to
move on to Plan 3!

00:15:02.952 --> 00:15:04.078
Hey, Sugar!

00:15:04.386 --> 00:15:06.855
If we use a spell
right before his eyes,

00:15:06.855 --> 00:15:08.789
he'll notice us for sure!

00:15:12.628 --> 00:15:14.095
Ooh! Now what?

00:15:20.469 --> 00:15:21.766
What's the matter?

00:15:24.006 --> 00:15:26.736
I see. You're upset
that you can't climb it.

00:15:27.876 --> 00:15:29.776
I hate these.

00:15:31.113 --> 00:15:32.348
It's too soon,

00:15:32.348 --> 00:15:33.337
to give up.

00:15:36.986 --> 00:15:39.045
You can play like this.

00:15:41.924 --> 00:15:42.686
See?

00:15:51.634 --> 00:15:54.330
Hey, Saga,
good timing.

00:15:54.803 --> 00:15:56.171
Help me out with
my experiment.

00:15:56.171 --> 00:15:58.833
Jan and Alan have
been hard to find lately.

00:16:02.378 --> 00:16:04.369
If you can't, then never mind.

00:16:05.948 --> 00:16:07.316
It's too bad, though.

00:16:07.316 --> 00:16:10.085
You could have witnessed the
greatest experiment of the century.

00:16:10.085 --> 00:16:11.074
Bye!

00:16:16.225 --> 00:16:17.860
How can he be a pianist?

00:16:17.860 --> 00:16:19.384
He can't fool me.

00:16:20.162 --> 00:16:21.754
He's nothing but a common...

00:17:24.593 --> 00:17:26.528
He's not bad.

00:17:26.528 --> 00:17:28.758
Yes.
He's magnificent.

00:17:30.499 --> 00:17:31.488
Ok.

00:17:31.934 --> 00:17:32.923
Waffo!

00:17:57.059 --> 00:17:58.048
Oh, my.

00:17:58.327 --> 00:18:01.063
He's so surprised
by Sugar's snow.

00:18:01.063 --> 00:18:04.133
Hmph! He can't
see us, after all!

00:18:04.133 --> 00:18:05.498
Right, Sugar?

00:18:05.667 --> 00:18:08.570
Yay! Yay!
I made it snow!

00:18:08.570 --> 00:18:10.060
I did the magic right!

00:18:12.875 --> 00:18:13.739
Saga!

00:18:14.376 --> 00:18:17.004
Did you see that?
My spell.

00:18:18.814 --> 00:18:19.803
Hey.

00:18:21.750 --> 00:18:22.808
Hey, Saga.

00:18:24.086 --> 00:18:25.519
-Saga?
-Saga?

00:18:52.815 --> 00:18:54.416
He's always fooling around.

00:18:54.416 --> 00:18:58.477
You hate his piano playing,
too, don't you, Mom?

00:19:01.056 --> 00:19:01.957
Yeah.

00:19:01.957 --> 00:19:05.761
Piano playing should be
more precise and beautiful.

00:19:05.761 --> 00:19:08.059
Gentle... and... and...

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.869
Oh... oh, no!
I messed up.

00:19:13.869 --> 00:19:15.097
Huh? Finished already?

00:19:16.905 --> 00:19:17.539
Hey.

00:19:17.539 --> 00:19:18.674
Saga!

00:19:18.674 --> 00:19:21.076
He heard your piano playing and
suddenly went into the store.
Welcome, Vincent.

00:19:21.076 --> 00:19:22.878
He heard your piano playing and
suddenly went into the store.
Good job, Saga,

00:19:22.878 --> 00:19:25.073
but there's no reason
to stop in the middle.

00:19:25.380 --> 00:19:26.779
Don't worry about mistakes.

00:19:27.382 --> 00:19:29.145
Just enjoy yourself.

00:19:30.018 --> 00:19:31.713
Ah. Um...

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:32.921
I know.

00:19:32.921 --> 00:19:34.556
Let's try playing together.

00:19:34.556 --> 00:19:37.024
It would be fun,
don't you think?

00:19:47.069 --> 00:19:48.366
No.

00:19:48.704 --> 00:19:50.262
I don't want you to touch...

00:19:51.206 --> 00:19:52.764
my mother's piano!

00:19:53.542 --> 00:19:54.531
Your mother's?

00:19:56.578 --> 00:19:58.045
S-Saga!

00:20:02.818 --> 00:20:05.048
I guess I upset her again.

00:20:07.122 --> 00:20:08.885
Saga!
Hey, Saga!

00:20:09.157 --> 00:20:11.284
What's the matter?
You're scaring me!

00:20:13.929 --> 00:20:17.626
This piano is a memento
of Saga's mother.

00:20:19.368 --> 00:20:21.598
A memento? Then...

00:20:21.770 --> 00:20:25.103
Saga's mother died
in an accident.

00:20:25.340 --> 00:20:29.003
Now she's living
with her grandmother,

00:20:29.545 --> 00:20:31.747
but I'm keeping
the piano here.

00:20:31.747 --> 00:20:34.614
There are too many memories,
and it's hard on her.

00:20:35.417 --> 00:20:37.085
I didn't know that.

00:20:37.085 --> 00:20:39.451
That's why Saga
plays piano here.

00:20:46.261 --> 00:20:47.694
Vincent,

00:20:48.564 --> 00:20:52.022
you must know
Ingrid Bergman.

00:20:53.702 --> 00:20:57.035
Saga's mother was a pianist.

00:20:58.307 --> 00:20:59.535
I see.

00:21:06.048 --> 00:21:08.039
Her role model...

00:21:08.717 --> 00:21:11.153
Oh! Why are you mad?

00:21:11.153 --> 00:21:13.822
Because I hate Vincent!

00:21:13.822 --> 00:21:14.811
Why?

00:21:14.990 --> 00:21:17.481
He's a bit strange,
but he's a nice bear.

00:21:17.826 --> 00:21:18.493
Because...

00:21:18.493 --> 00:21:20.662
You should be
friends with him, Saga.

00:21:20.662 --> 00:21:23.028
He's good at
the piano, too.

00:21:23.332 --> 00:21:25.061
Because that's
not piano playing!

00:21:25.500 --> 00:21:27.127
My mother was more precise.

00:21:46.989 --> 00:21:49.725
Wow! Everyone's
copying Mr. Bear!

00:21:49.725 --> 00:21:51.893
There are little bears
everywhere!

00:21:51.893 --> 00:21:53.087
Waffo!

00:22:20.656 --> 00:22:25.494
Wishes upon the Moon

00:22:25.494 --> 00:22:28.797
Melting in the water

00:22:28.797 --> 00:22:34.069
I found a street lined with trees

00:22:34.069 --> 00:22:38.940
Songs of stardust

00:22:38.940 --> 00:22:47.449
The breeze crossing over
the Bridge of Rainbows

00:22:47.449 --> 00:22:52.721
You already knew...

00:22:52.721 --> 00:22:57.592
the happiness of
connecting our hearts

00:22:57.592 --> 00:22:59.594
Sugar Snow

00:22:59.594 --> 00:23:07.669
When powdery snow
whirls in town

00:23:07.669 --> 00:23:13.108
the season of flower
blossoms is near...

00:23:13.108 --> 00:23:17.101
and, I think of you.

00:23:19.481 --> 00:23:28.056
The love that melts
our hearts and...

00:23:28.056 --> 00:23:34.052
the dreams are in your heart

00:23:39.434 --> 00:23:42.804
Preview of Next Episode

00:23:42.804 --> 00:23:45.707
Preview of Next Episode
Sugar, what are you doing?

00:23:45.707 --> 00:23:47.075
I'm being a piccolo.

00:23:47.075 --> 00:23:49.578
After seeing Vincent perform,
I thought of it.

00:23:49.578 --> 00:23:53.446
This way, even if I can't play the
piccolo well, I can still have fun.

00:23:54.683 --> 00:23:57.652
Too bad you're not
better with a real piccolo.

00:23:59.087 --> 00:24:02.624
"A Little Snow Fairy Sugar"
The Next Episode Is
"Good-bye, Mr. Bear."

00:24:02.624 --> 00:24:03.658
What?

00:24:03.658 --> 00:24:06.559
I'm taking Vincent's place?
